# M7 flow (D-107; Stage 9 "Finale and ending"): the end of the journey on
# the real route with no input after the last jump. Title flow with the
# run started in Strobl: flow_m6_bad_ischl_to_cafe_zauner's 5703 frames
# (Strobl and Bad Ischl cleared, the route map Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner
# in Wait, the Café Zauner intro from 5643 with the run carried over:
# Normal, score 35600, lives 3, 75 Oblaten), 90 more idle frames of the
# intro, then cafe_zauner_solver.replay unchanged from 5793 (play frame
# = frame - 5793): the boss beaten, the goal_stollen touched in the air
# (8063, 10 000 + „Zaunerstollen!"), the Serve after she lands, the tally
# and the clear panel; then, since Café Zauner is the route's last
# station, the ending, every phase run out without START: Map 8501,
# Scene 8741, Bill 9101 (the run's totals across three stages), Credits
# 9701 (6 pages of 180), Ende 10781 (its 600 frames), and the title
# (11381) with the run reset to its first stage (Strobl: score 0, 3
# lives, 0 Oblaten, Normal) and the „durchgespielt" mark; the replay
# ends on it (11411). A new time_limit for Café Zauner changes the tally
# and moves every frame after it.
level  = strobl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1900..1900 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt no_event=Died
expect = state=title cleared=true stage=strobl score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0 power=normal
